      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-sat",
      "text": "Saturday morning in San Francisco. You're waiting for a helicopter tour of the bay.",
      "file": "03-sat.mp3",
      "align": "03-sat.align.json",
      "seconds": 5.17,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 4.64,
      "hash": "b289540e03464419",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-felt",
      "text": "Did you feel that? A tiny earthquake. California gets hundreds like it every year.",
      "file": "04-felt.mp3",
      "align": "04-felt.align.json",
      "seconds": 5.28,
      "speech_start": 0.04,
      "speech_end": 4.92,
      "hash": "fbe102a045337bde",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-lightning",
      "text": "Magnitude three is about as much energy as a bolt of lightning.",
      "file": "05-lightning.mp3",
      "align": "05-lightning.align.json",
      "seconds": 4.08,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 3.58,
      "hash": "ca2b9a53435ae86e",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-but",
      "text": "But this one isn't stopping.",
      "file": "06-but.mp3",
      "align": "06-but.align.json",
      "seconds": 2.06,
      "speech_start": 0.06,
      "speech_end": 1.6,
      "hash": "808ac8393e119a82",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-rule",
      "text": "And every minute, it gets one magnitude stronger.",
      "file": "07-rule.mp3",
      "align": "07-rule.align.json",
      "seconds": 3.66,
      "speech_start": 0.04,
      "speech_end": 3.18,
      "hash": "ec0015ac40bc8f17",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-x32",
      "text": "That doesn't sound like much. But every step up is thirty-two times more energy. Two steps, a thousand times.",
