      "speech_end": 1.28,
      "hash": "2203ac3f71b36599",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "58-cafe",
      "text": "Right where you were sitting six minutes ago.",
      "file": "58-cafe.mp3",
      "align": "58-cafe.align.json",
      "seconds": 2.72,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 2.22,
      "hash": "7bfb273bae22f59d",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "59-la",
      "text": "Los Angeles is at magnitude seven.",
      "file": "59-la.mp3",
      "align": "59-la.align.json",
      "seconds": 2.8,
      "speech_start": 0.06,
      "speech_end": 2.32,
      "hash": "347d1c825b3ae357",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "60-mexico",
      "text": "Mexico City, magnitude six. It's built on an old lake bed, so it shakes like jelly.",
      "file": "60-mexico.mp3",
      "align": "60-mexico.align.json",
      "seconds": 6.87,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 6.2,
      "hash": "bb387312cbb236e5",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "61-m8",
      "text": "Minute eight. Magnitude ten.",
      "file": "61-m8.mp3",
      "align": "61-m8.align.json",
      "seconds": 2.87,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 2.4,
      "hash": "1b78d56c802ce661",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "62-never2",
      "text": "This has never happened. The strongest earthquake ever recorded hit Chile in nineteen-sixty. Nine point five.",
      "file": "62-never2.mp3",
      "align": "62-never2.align.json",
      "seconds": 8.31,
      "speech_start": 0.12,
      "speech_end": 7.82,
      "hash": "fe7faf62270ddbf0",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "63-fault",
      "text": "No fault on Earth is long enough to make a ten. The rule doesn't care.",
      "file": "63-fault.mp3",
      "align": "63-fault.align.json",
      "seconds": 5.02,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 4.6,
      "hash": "e10ab64443deed5a",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "64-gravity",
      "text": "Now the ground jumps faster than gravity can pull things back down.",
      "file": "64-gravity.mp3",
      "align": "64-gravity.align.json",
      "seconds": 4.31,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 3.86,
      "hash": "cd921795a81a4625",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "65-month",
      "text": "A month of all the energy humans use.",
      "file": "65-month.mp3",
      "align": "65-month.align.json",
      "seconds": 3.11,
      "speech_start": 0.04,
      "speech_end": 2.64,
      "hash": "534ea99838177f0c",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "66-dam",
      "text": "The Hoover Dam. Lake Mead is coming through.",
      "file": "66-dam.mp3",
      "align": "66-dam.align.json",
      "seconds": 3.5,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 3,
      "hash": "b488266e127bb24d",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "67-needle",
      "text": "Seattle. The Space Needle.",
      "file": "67-needle.mp3",
      "align": "67-needle.align.json",
      "seconds": 2.3,
      "speech_start": 0.12,
      "speech_end": 1.86,
      "hash": "4e53f3166cdd1c79",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "68-crack",
      "text": "From space, you'd see the crack. It runs from Mexico to Oregon.",
      "file": "68-crack.mp3",
      "align": "68-crack.align.json",
      "seconds": 4.94,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 4.38,
      "hash": "fd15f1924abae308",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "69-m9",
      "text": "Minute nine. Magnitude eleven.",
      "file": "69-m9.mp3",
      "align": "69-m9.align.json",
      "seconds": 3.11,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 2.68,
      "hash": "982a1fa55802fd38",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "70-years",
      "text": "Three years of all the energy humans use, in one earthquake.",
      "file": "70-years.mp3",
      "align": "70-years.align.json",
      "seconds": 4.94,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 4.4,
      "hash": "12763501486a876b",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "71-air",
      "text": "Now even the air is shaking.",
      "file": "71-air.mp3",
      "align": "71-air.align.json",
      "seconds": 2.46,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 1.86,
      "hash": "0c1fd883f2acfb21",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "72-tokyo",
      "text": "Tokyo. Two in the morning. The Skytree.",
      "file": "72-tokyo.mp3",
      "align": "72-tokyo.align.json",
      "seconds": 3.66,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 3.14,
      "hash": "96e202e5d62e020d",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "73-dubai",
      "text": "Dubai. The tallest building in the world.",
      "file": "73-dubai.mp3",
      "align": "73-dubai.align.json",
      "seconds": 3.5,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 3,
      "hash": "3dc2d253a9c39aa8",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "74-istanbul",
      "text": "Istanbul. The bridge between Europe and Asia.",
      "file": "74-istanbul.mp3",
      "align": "74-istanbul.align.json",
      "seconds": 3.74,
      "speech_start": 0.12,
      "speech_end": 3.16,
      "hash": "4c63192eb93e25db",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "75-dozens",
      "text": "Two dozen earthquakes around the world, and every one of them is still growing.",
      "file": "75-dozens.mp3",
      "align": "75-dozens.align.json",
      "seconds": 5.17,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 4.7,
      "hash": "3fdcb5c4d70a8dc2",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "76-fuel",
      "text": "Your pilot checks the fuel. Two hours left.",
      "file": "76-fuel.mp3",
      "align": "76-fuel.align.json",
      "seconds": 3.42,
      "speech_start": 0.06,
      "speech_end": 2.88,
      "hash": "0c9d64d62128bec7",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "77-nowhere",
      "text": "But there's nowhere left to land.",
      "file": "77-nowhere.mp3",
      "align": "77-nowhere.align.json",
      "seconds": 2.3,
      "speech_start": 0.04,
      "speech_end": 1.68,
      "hash": "8c44c7951502382b",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "78-m10",
      "text": "Minute ten. Magnitude twelve.",
      "file": "78-m10.mp3",
      "align": "78-m10.align.json",
      "seconds": 3.11,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 2.64,
      "hash": "7239a7024d827f6a",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "79-sun",
      "text": "As much energy as four days of sunlight, on the whole planet.",
      "file": "79-sun.mp3",
      "align": "79-sun.align.json",
      "seconds": 4.7,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 4.26,
      "hash": "53c6c35d001d9b23",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "80-cracking",
      "text": "From space, it looks like the Earth is cracking open.",
      "file": "80-cracking.mp3",
      "align": "80-cracking.align.json",
      "seconds": 3.66,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 3.28,
      "hash": "db2d0779b57d5f8f",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "81-melt",
      "text": "Along the biggest cracks, the rock slides so fast that friction melts it.",
      "file": "81-melt.mp3",
      "align": "81-melt.align.json",
      "seconds": 5.09,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 4.62,
      "hash": "ea7412c42d6805d6",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "82-dino",
      "text": "One more minute, and it passes the asteroid that killed the dinosaurs.",
      "file": "82-dino.mp3",
      "align": "82-dino.align.json",
      "seconds": 4.39,
      "speech_start": 0.12,
      "speech_end": 3.92,
      "hash": "0a509cc6aa077604",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "83-seven",
      "text": "Seven more, and it's enough to blow the whole planet apart.",
      "file": "83-seven.mp3",
      "align": "83-seven.align.json",
      "seconds": 4,
      "speech_start": 0.14,
      "speech_end": 3.38,
      "hash": "4d68989b8e6eeda9",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "84-last",
      "text": "You have two hours of fuel. And seven minutes of planet.",
      "file": "84-last.mp3",
      "align": "84-last.align.json",
      "seconds": 4.08,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 3.58,
      "hash": "8b0b6d3d72e722c9",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "85-question",
      "text": "Who would you call?",
      "file": "85-question.mp3",
      "align": "85-question.align.json",
      "seconds": 1.18,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 0.92,
      "hash": "adc8549b8df9efe4",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    }
  ]
}
